# 统一换行：源码 LF，Windows 脚本 CRLF（避免 git 每次警告、也避免 .cmd 因 LF 出错）
* text=auto

*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf

*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要做任何换行/合并处理
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.jar  binary
*.apk  binary
*.zip  binary
*.tif  binary
